{"ticker":"VRSK","updated":"2026-10-30T23:21:41Z","profile":{"longName":"Verisk Analytics, Inc.","shortName":"Verisk Analytics, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Consulting Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.verisk.com","fullTimeEmployees":8000,"marketCap":25549625344,"trailingPE":30.153608,"forwardPE":22.572638,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":8.147202,"pegRatio":1.6,"targetMeanPrice":226.4706,"targetHighPrice":260.0,"targetLowPrice":195.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":17,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.044,"earningsGrowth":-0.034,"grossMargins":0.70179003,"operatingMargins":0.45106998,"profitMargins":0.28237,"totalRevenue":3136000000,"beta":0.692,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":227.16,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":155.94,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.05},"summary":"Verisk Analytics, Inc. engages in the provision of data analytics and technology solutions to the insurance industry in the United States and internationally. The company offers underwriting solutions, including forms, rules, and loss costs services that provides policy language, prospective loss costs, policy writing and rating rules, and underwriting solutions for risk selection and segmentation, pricing, and workflow optimization; underwriting data and analytics solutions, which provides property and auto specific rating, and underwriting information solutions; catastrophe modelling and risk solutions; life insurance solutions for transforming current workflows in life insurance underwriting, claim insights, policy administration, unclaimed property/equity, compliance and fraud detection, and actuarial and portfolio modelling; specialty business solutions, which provides full end-to-end management of insurance and reinsurance business; and international underwriting solutions. It also provides claims insurance solutions, including property estimating solutions, provide data, analytics, and networking solutions for professionals involved in estimating all phases of building repair and reconstruction; anti-fraud solutions that provide fraud-detection tools for the property and casualty insurance industry; casualty solutions, which focus on compliance, casualty claims decision,","summary_zh":"Verisk Analytics, Inc. 致力於為美國和國際保險業提供數據分析和技術解決方案。該公司提供承保解決方案，包括表格、規則和損失成本服務，提供保單語言、預期損失成本、保單撰寫和評級規則，以及風險選擇和細分、定價和工作流程優化的承保解決方案；承保數據和分析解決方案，提供財產和汽車特定評級以及承保資訊解決方案；災難建模和風險解決方案；人壽保險解決方案，用於改變人壽保險承保、索賠洞察、保單管理、無人認領財產/股權、合規和欺詐檢測以及精算和投資組合建模方面的當前工作流程；專業業務解決方案，提供保險和再保險業務的全面端到端管理；和國際承保解決方案。它還提供索賠保險解決方案，包括財產估算解決方案，為參與建築維修和重建所有階段估算的專業人員提供數據、分析和網路解決方案；反欺詐解決方案，為財產和意外傷害保險行業提供欺詐檢測工具；傷亡解決方案，重點關注合規性、傷亡索賠決策、","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"諮詢服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":268.31,"h":268.54,"l":263.29,"c":265.0,"v":1116300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":265.0,"h":268.54,"l":265.0,"c":268.44,"v":933500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":268.79,"h":270.84,"l":267.18,"c":270.05,"v":1103500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":271.04,"h":273.72,"l":268.11,"c":270.31,"v":1005000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":270.5,"h":273.2,"l":268.32,"c":273.03,"v":1240400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":272.84,"h":273.83,"l":268.22,"c":268.66,"v":902700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":266.7,"h":268.19,"l":261.42,"c":262.77,"v":954200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":262.74,"h":267.26,"l":262.74,"c":266.24,"v":1083400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":266.57,"h":267.07,"l":262.03,"c":262.2,"v":895500},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":261.85,"h":263.67,"l":254.66,"c":255.08,"v":1402000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":254.72,"h":256.94,"l":251.13,"c":251.83,"v":1697100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":250.68,"h":255.23,"l":248.98,"c":249.69,"v":1515400},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":248.55,"h":251.2,"l":245.04,"c":245.33,"v":1669900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":246.13,"h":246.18,"l":242.57,"c":243.47,"v":2380600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":241.82,"h":244.4,"l":239.83,"c":244.18,"v":1549600},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":243.38,"h":245.86,"l":240.17,"c":242.3,"v":1077600},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":241.95,"h":245.84,"l":240.92,"c":242.95,"v":1179600},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":244.0,"h":246.03,"l":240.89